# Assistant content: a blockquote. internal/tui/markdown.go's BlockQuote
# style uses a muted "│ " indent token (glamour draws no border/box, just
# this per-line indent) with the quoted text itself Faint.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-blockquote.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /missing/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /│.*Retry-After header/
EXPECT /That's the part the tests were missing/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
